OL,3,GNEWSAA38 road scheme cancelled by
OL,4,Agovernment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has announced a major
OL,7,Fproject to increase the capacity of the
OL,8,FA38 in Derby will not go ahead.
OL,10,FThe estimated #600m A38 scheme was
OL,11,Fapproved by the government in July
OL,12,F2025, and would have seen roads
OL,13,Fwidened, with flyovers and underpasses
OL,14,Fconstructed at the Little Eaton,
OL,15,FMarkeaton and Kingsway roundabouts.
OL,17,FEarlier in the year, the government
OL,18,Fannounced the scheme - along with a
OL,19,Fproject to improve the A46 in
OL,20,FNottinghamshire - could be scrapped in
OL,21,Forder to pay for increased defence
OL,22,Fspending.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
