OL,3,GNEWSAA38 road scheme cancelled by
OL,4,Agovernment
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Thursday, Mayor of the East Midlands
OL,7,FClaire Ward described the cancellation
OL,8,Fof the scheme, along with the proposed
OL,9,Fcancellation of the A46 Newark Bypass
OL,10,Fin Nottinghamshire, as "short-sighted".
